30,Chemistry,Inorganic Chemistry,"Acids, Bases & Salts","With the rise in temperature, surface tension ",Increases,Decreases,Remain unchanged,Increases then decreases,B,"Increased kinetic energy weakens the cohesive forces between molecules at the surface, causing the surface tension to Decrease.",IOM
