52,Chemistry,Mixed Topics,General Knowledge,A Boat having length of 3 m and breadth 2 m is floating only is only. The boat sinks by 1 cm when a man is on it. The mass of the man is,6 kg,60 kg,10 kg,12 kg,B,Calculation: Mass = Density × Volume displaced. M=ρ×V=(1000 kg/m3)×(3 m×2 m×0.01 m)=60 kg.,IOM
