207,Chemistry,Physical Chemistry,Atomic Structure,"In which one of the following, 1 Faraday of electricity will liberate 1/2 gram atom of the metal? ",AuCl3​,CuSO4​,CaCl2​,AgNO3​,B,Calculation: 1 F liberates 1 equivalent. 1 equivalent=1/Valency gram atom. 1/2 gram atom means Valency=2. CuSO4​ (Cu2+) has a valency of 2.,IOM
