275,Chemistry,Mixed Topics,General Knowledge,"If one mole of Methane is converted into products, then which one of the following statement is true? ",2 moles of CO2​ are formed,1 mole of H2​O is formed,1 mole of CO2​ is formed,2 moles of O2​ are consumed,C,Methane combustion: CH4​+2O2​→CO2​+2H2​O. 1 mole of CO2​ is formed.,IOM
276,Chemistry,Physical Chemistry,Atomic Structure,Which one of the following complex compound has an incorrect formula?,K2​[PtCl6​],Na2​[Fe(CN)5​NO],K4​[Fe(CN)6​],Na2​[Fe(CN)6​],D,Na2​[Fe(CN)6​] is incorrect. The complex should be neutral or the charge should balance the counter-ion. Fe2+ requires Na4​[Fe(CN)6​] and Fe3+ requires Na3​[Fe(CN)6​].,IOM
